canvas 520 300
label "Boundary: this node declares its surfaces (highlighted: llms-txt, chunks, mcp, webmcp, a2a-card, solid, responder), its visibility and its retirement; a browser reads it cross-origin, and an agent walks peer nodes over HTTPS with a hop limit; nodes never call nodes"
caption "The highlighted declaration is the plugin contract: declare, pin, inherit, prove. Everything that crosses the dashed border is static and client-side."
region node 160 20 200 260 "this node"
box surf 174 40 172 100 "declared surfaces:|llms-txt · chunks · mcp|webmcp · a2a-card · solid|responder" acc
box vis 174 156 172 44 "public or restricted"
box tomb 174 216 172 44 "retire · tombstone"
box browser 16 60 110 50 "browser|(cross-origin)"
arrow browser surf
box peer 394 60 110 50 "peer node"
box agent 394 160 110 50 "agent walks|peers"
arrow agent peer
arrow agent node
text 447 126 "HTTPS only, hop limit 3" size=10
note "static and client-side: nodes never call nodes"
